{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From Planet Earth... He has charted a course... For Revenge! Travel to distant star systems on a quest to free the galaxy from the tyrannical alien empire of the Anunnaki.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the Giant Crab and spread your trail of destruction far and wide in both planet-based and space-based levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variety of alien cities and installations for you to stomp all over. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devastating power ups to cause even more destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story based campaign of galactic liberation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat imposing alien military units including spider-mechs and massive starships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planet based \u201ckaiju mode\u201d and interstellar \u201cspace mode\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/extras/MarketGIF1.gif?t=1743726044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2845770?t=1743726044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2845770?t=1743726044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743726044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743726044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr